    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Mark Popadiuk",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/110611932002664154608/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIgtV2f5DfvVOuqI9bOyzNSO8EhUNtLeMAO1Lec0B6UM_MnSw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "APA and Paul-Andre renovating my house a little over a year ago.  We’re very happy with the quality of work but more importantly, it’s the owner’s, Paul-Andre’s, professionalism, responsiveness and after sales service that drives his rating.  P-A always took my calls, responded to messages and would swing by personally to check on the work.\n\nOne instance stood out, when the kitchen was being installed and neither the fridge installer or kitchen cabinet installers wanted the liability of panelling the fridge and Paul-Andre personally took ownership and fixed the issue.\n\nThey are good people to work with and that in my opinion, is an important quality in selecting a contractor.  I would highly recommend them.",
        "time": 1681758622,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Barbara Seale",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/113347243683562616087/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjUyHZUT9iat618F6E-3sW76vctUh_j1tj6yZrqyX4jLKTM6JDU=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba3",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Fantastic experience to deal with them.  Fair pricing, the entire Team is extremely professional and very talented.  We are very happy with our whole basement remodel, including a full kitchen.  Wouldn't even dream of using someone else.  Highly reccomend!",
        "time": 1730396063,
        "translated": false
