        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVB1nM-5upB3XHEiGKKyV9Qlw5pdsZLzA7VNCVb79v94pNHkg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "2 years ago",
        "text": "The best building experience of my life. Extremely skilled craftsmen, fantastic quality, and excellent customer service. I highly recommend them!",
        "time": 1698175879,
        "translated": true
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Lucie Mercier-Harris",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106242939817423166854/reviews",
        "language": "en-US",
        "original_language": "fr",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjXoYdSCjAFTdLUcafWAv6U7OczPZqN5h3g86UXa-wy_aBNsLeWTFw=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "We suffered a fire and had to rebuild our entire garage and more than half of the interior of our house. APA was there throughout the entire process, providing prompt support. We were confident the work would be done professionally. Excellent communication during the 8-month renovation, with a team that showed compassion for its clients. We don't always choose to renovate, or when to do it, but we can choose our general contractor! I recommend them without hesitation.",
